=\"content\">\n            <p>el senyor <b>$name</b> ha volgut contactar amb nosaltres amb el correu <b>$email</b>.</p>\n            <p><b>$title</b></p>\n            <p>$message</p>\n            <p><b>Equip de LleidaHack</b></p>\n            <br><br><br>\n            <div class=\"social-icons-container\">\n                <p>Si has rebut aquest correu és perquè t'has registrat a la web de Lleidahack.</p>\n                <a href=\"https://twitter.com/lleidahack\"><img class=\"social-icon\" src=\"$_static_folder/x.png\" alt=\"x\"><a>\n                <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/lleidahack/\"><img class=\"social-icon\" src=\"$_static_folder/linkedin.png\" alt=\"Linkedin\"><a>\n                <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lleidahack/\"><img class=\"social-icon\" src=\"$_static_folder/instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram\"><a>\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@LleidaHack\"><img class=\"social-icon\" src=\"$_static_folder/youtube.png\" alt=\"Youtube\"><a>\n                <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/lleidahack\"><img class=\"social-icon\" src=\"$_static_folder/twitch.png\" alt=\"Twitch\"><a>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "reset_password": "<html>\n<head>\n    <style>\n        \n        body {\n            font-family: monospace;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #ffe0d2;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 20px auto;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        }\n\n        .header {\n            min-height: 200px;\n            text-align: center;\n            color: white;\n            background-image: url('$_static_folder/fondo_taronja.png');\n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center;\n            position: relative; \n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            max-width: 400px; \n            position: absolute; \n          